values
  ('2026-10-20', 'community', 'https://www.management.fju.edu.tw/esubweb/immbaengindex/news-detail.php?NID=430', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1606761568499-6d2451b23c66?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=70', -60, 'imMBA Kickoff Lunch | A new semester, new connections', 'imMBA 開學聚餐｜新學期，新連結', 'First-, second- and third-year students met over lunch to share course advice and study-abroad experiences.', '碩一、碩二與剛從海外雙碩士回國的學長姐一起聚餐，分享選課與留學經驗。', 'A new semester is here, and imMBA kicked things off with a lively lunch gathering.

First- and second-year students met classmates who had just returned from their overseas dual master''s programs. For new students it was a chance to ask seniors about course selection, academic planning and studying abroad; those considering a dual degree could hear first-hand what the application process and life overseas are really like.

Over lunch, students from different year groups got to know one another, shared stories and made new connections. Here''s to another great semester of learning and growing together at imMBA.', '新學期開始，國際經管以一場熱鬧的聚餐揭開序幕。

碩一、碩二同學與剛結束海外雙碩士課程返國的碩三學長姐齊聚一堂。對新生來說，這是向學長姐請教選課、學習規劃與出國經驗的好機會；有意參加跨國雙碩士的同學，也能直接聽到從申請到海外生活的第一手分享。

餐敘之間，不同年級的同學彼此認識、交換故事，建立新的連結。期待在 imMBA 一起度過又一個收穫滿滿的學期。'),
  ('2026-10-16', 'admissions', 'https://www.management.fju.edu.tw/esubweb/immbaengindex/news-detail.php?NID=429', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522202176988-66273c2fd55f?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=70', -70, 'Fall 2027 admissions — now open in two rounds (international students)', 'Fall 2027 外籍生招生開放：分兩梯次申請', 'First round: Oct 15 – Dec 4, 2026. Second round: Mar 1 – May 15, 2027 (Taiwan time).', '第一梯次：2026/10/15–12/4；第二梯次：2027/3/1–5/15（台灣時間）。', '<strong>When to apply</strong></p><ul><li>First round: October 15, 2026, 13:00 – December 4, 2026, 23:59 (Taiwan time)</li><li>Second round: March 1, 2027, 13:00 – May 15, 2027, 23:59 (Taiwan time)</li></ul><p>

<strong>How to apply:</strong> complete the online application and upload every required document through the application system.

<strong>Required documents:</strong></p><ol><li>Autobiography (English)</li><li>Study plan (English)</li><li>English proficiency certificate (TOEFL, IELTS or TOEIC) — CEFR B2 preferred</li><li>Two recommendation letters</li><li>Any other materials that may support the application</li></ol><p>

This track is open to international students only; local applicants should see the <a href="https://www.management.fju.edu.tw/subweb/immba/enroll.php?IID=26" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Chinese admissions page</a>.', '<strong>申請期間</strong></p><ul><li>第一梯次：2026 年 10 月 15 日 13:00 – 12 月 4 日 23:59（台灣時間）</li><li>第二梯次：2027 年 3 月 1 日 13:00 – 5 月 15 日 23:59（台灣時間）</li></ul><p>

<strong>申請方式：</strong>於線上申請系統完成報名並上傳所有應備文件。

<strong>應備文件：</strong></p><ol><li>自傳（英文）</li><li>讀書計畫（英文）</li><li>英語能力證明（TOEFL、IELTS 或 TOEIC），建議達 CEFR B2</li><li>推薦信兩封</li><li>其他有助審查之資料</li></ol><p>

本管道限外籍學生；本地生請見<a href="https://www.management.fju.edu.tw/subweb/immba/enroll.php?IID=26" target="_blank" rel="noopener">中文版招生資訊</a>。'),
  ('2026-10-13', 'partners', 'https://www.management.fju.edu.tw/esubweb/immbaengindex/news-detail.php?NID=428', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1523482580672-f109ba8cb9be?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=70', -50, 'Next stop: Australia''s Gold Coast? | imMBA × Bond University', '下一站澳洲黃金海岸？｜imMBA × Bond University', 'Talks are under way to add Bond University as a fourth dual master''s destination, alongside the USA, France and Spain.', '雙方正洽談 1+1 雙碩士合作，澳洲可望成為繼美、法、西之後的第四個目的地。', 'Thinking about a master''s degree in an English-speaking country? Beyond the U.S. and the U.K., how about Australia?

imMBA may soon welcome Bond University as a new Australian partner. Both sides have been discussing a 1+1 dual master''s partnership, and Christine Huang, Bond University''s International Regional Coordinator, recently visited imMBA in person. The two universities are now working on course arrangements and credit recognition.

Located on the Gold Coast, Bond University is known for small classes and a hands-on approach; its business school holds AACSB and EQUIS accreditations. Discussions are still under way, and we hope Australia will join the U.S., France and Spain as a dual master''s destination for imMBA students.', '想在英語系國家攻讀碩士嗎？除了美國與英國，澳洲也是很好的選擇。

國際經管可能即將迎來新的澳洲夥伴 Bond University。雙方正洽談 1+1 跨國雙碩士合作，該校國際區域協調人 Christine Huang 近日也親自來訪，兩校目前正就課程安排與學分抵免進行討論。

Bond University 位於黃金海岸，以小班制與重視實作的教學聞名，商學院並通過 AACSB 與 EQUIS 認證。合作仍在討論中，期待澳洲能繼美國、法國、西班牙之後，成為 imMBA 學生的另一個雙碩士目的地。'),
  ('2026-10-06', 'partners', 'https://www.management.fju.edu.tw/esubweb/immbaengindex/news-detail.php?NID=426', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1498243691581-b145c3f54a5a?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=70', -40, 'imMBA × UT Dallas | Dual master''s collaboration moving forward', 'imMBA × UT Dallas｜跨國雙碩士合作進行中', 'A dual master''s partnership with The University of Texas at Dallas is advancing, together with a new sustainability scholarship.', '與美國德州大學達拉斯分校的雙碩士合作持續推進，並設有永續獎學金。', 'imMBA is advancing a dual master''s degree partnership with The University of Texas at Dallas (UTD). Through credit recognition between the two universities, students may complete both degrees more efficiently in terms of time and cost. Details will be announced once finalised.

Fu Jen distinguished alumni have also established the “Fu Jen–UTD Sustainability Scholarship” with support from the ECLAT Foundation. Each recipient receives US$1,000 and may reapply as long as the eligibility requirements are met.

Two years, more than one master''s degree: imMBA continues to expand its dual-degree programs and international learning opportunities.', '國際經管正推進與美國德州大學達拉斯分校（UTD）的跨國雙碩士合作。透過兩校學分互相承認，同學可以更節省時間與費用地取得兩個碩士學位，細節將於定案後公布。

輔大傑出校友並在 ECLAT 基金會支持下設立「輔仁－UTD 永續獎學金」，每位獲獎者可獲 1,000 美元，符合資格者可再次申請。

兩年，不只一個碩士學位：國際經管持續拓展雙碩士計畫與國際學習機會。'),
  ('2026-09-29', 'admissions', 'https://www.management.fju.edu.tw/esubweb/immbaengindex/news-detail.php?NID=424', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1524178232363-1fb2b075b655?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=70', -30, 'Admissions info session recap | Local applications open tomorrow', '招生說明會回顧｜本地生明日起開放報名', 'Highlights from the September 29 session, and the local application window: Sep 30 – Oct 13.', '9/29 說明會重點整理，本地生報名期間 9/30–10/13。', 'Missed the information session? Here are the highlights.

imMBA Chair Dr. Yi-Ning Tu walked students through the Admissions Guide, covering the application process, program resources and international study opportunities, and shared updates on potential new partner universities in Europe and the U.S.

First-year student Zoe also told her story: when she applied, her TOEIC score was in the 500s; after a year in imMBA''s English-taught environment she reached 805. She shared practical tips on preparing application materials and standing out — proof that where you start does not limit where you can go.

Local student application period: September 30 – October 13. Copies of the Admissions Guide are available at the imMBA office, LM208-1.', '錯過招生說明會了嗎？以下是重點整理。

國際經管主任杜逸寧老師帶同學認識《招生指南》，說明申請流程、學程資源與國際學習機會，並分享歐美潛在合作學校的最新進度。

碩一同學 Zoe 也分享了自己的故事：申請時多益成績只有 500 多分，在 imMBA 全英環境學習一年後進步到 805 分。她同時分享了準備申請資料、凸顯個人特色的實用建議——起點不會限制你能走多遠。

本地生報名期間：9 月 30 日至 10 月 13 日。歡迎到 LM208-1 國際經管辦公室索取《招生指南》。'),
  ('2026-09-22', 'admissions', 'https://www.management.fju.edu.tw/esubweb/immbaengindex/news-detail.php?NID=423', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1497366216548-37526070297c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=70', -20, 'Two years, more than one master''s degree', '兩年，不只一個碩士學位', 'Unlike an exchange, the 1+1 dual degree lets you graduate from two universities. Info session: Sep 29, 12:10, LM202.', '與交換不同，1+1 雙碩士可取得兩校學位。說明會：9/29 12:10，LM202。', 'What if your two years of graduate study could take you beyond Taiwan — to the U.S., France or Spain — and lead to a second master''s degree?

imMBA offers 1+1 dual master''s degree opportunities. Unlike a regular exchange, students who complete the requirements of both universities earn two master''s degrees.

What other opportunities does imMBA offer? Is a fully English-taught program right for you? Join the information session and find out.

<strong>Fu Jen imMBA 2027 admissions information session</strong> — September 29 (Tue.), 12:10 PM, LM202 Meeting Room.', '如果研究所兩年，能帶你走出台灣——前往美國、法國或西班牙——並取得第二個碩士學位呢？

國際經管提供 1+1 跨國雙碩士機會。與一般交換不同，完成兩校畢業規定的同學可以取得兩個碩士學位。

imMBA 還有哪些機會？全英語授課適不適合你？申請前又該知道什麼？歡迎參加招生說明會。

<strong>國際經管 2027 招生說明會</strong>：9 月 29 日（二）12:10，LM202 會議室。')
on conflict do nothing;

select count(*) as announcements from public.news;
